{
    "title": "Gaze - Live Random Video Chat",
    "description": "<b>Introducing Gaze, your go-to for making global connections anytime, anywhere. Gaze is a random video chat app that gets you talking in seconds with friends online and live.</b>\r\n\r\nGaze is here for you:\r\n\r\n\u2605 Online video chat\r\nDon\u2019t wait, let\u2019s meet! Swipe to connect with someone new. If you are not interested we have millions of Gazers, so don\u2019t worry - there are plenty of chances to meet new friends. Also you don\u2019t waste your time searching for someone you like from crowds. Have real live conversations and start live video chatting right away.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Real-time translation\r\nWe support 20+ languages because we believe different cultures make Gaze a better video chat app. Gaze allows you to connect, have meaningful conversations and discover diverse cultures with live translation. If the language barriers are too hard to overcome you can always type and see how real-time translation works wonders to bring random people together.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Want to be totally surprised?\r\nWe also have random video chats. You want to have some fun, we know. Forget the filters and just swipe to meet random people online.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Everyone likes a full message box, right?\r\nDM people you liked. If you are a little shy to video chat instantly, DM first and enjoy texting. You can hop on a direct call whenever you feel comfortable.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Filters to find the most desirable profiles\r\nGaze filters your preferences and finds the perfect people for you to chat with. It is the easiest way to meet strangers who are just like you and share common interests!\r\n\r\n\u2605 Follow your friends\r\nFollow your favorite people to get notified when they are online and live video chat with them anytime. You can also increase your following on Gaze and be one of the popular Gazers.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Private and secure\r\nGaze has a 24-hour moderation. If your connection behaves offensively, is rude to you, or does something else that is against the laws or Gaze policies, you can always report users while live video chatting and they will get reviewed by our moderation team.\r\n\r\nLots of Love,\r\n\ud83d\udc9b \u2764\ufe0fGaze Team \u2764\ufe0f \ud83d\udc9b\r\n\r\nIG: gaze_videochat\r\nQuestions? Contact us at customerdesk@gazeapp.mobi\r\nPrivacy Policy: www.gazeapp.mobi/privacy\r\nTerms of Service: www.gazeapp.mobi/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Introducing Gaze, your go-to for making global connections anytime, anywhere. Gaze is a random video chat app that gets you talking in seconds with friends online and live.</b><br><br>Gaze is here for you:<br><br>\u2605 Online video chat<br>Don\u2019t wait, let\u2019s meet! Swipe to connect with someone new. If you are not interested we have millions of Gazers, so don\u2019t worry - there are plenty of chances to meet new friends. Also you don\u2019t waste your time searching for someone you like from crowds. Have real live conversations and start live video chatting right away.<br><br>\u2605 Real-time translation<br>We support 20+ languages because we believe different cultures make Gaze a better video chat app. Gaze allows you to connect, have meaningful conversations and discover diverse cultures with live translation. If the language barriers are too hard to overcome you can always type and see how real-time translation works wonders to bring random people together.<br><br>\u2605 Want to be totally surprised?<br>We also have random video chats. You want to have some fun, we know. Forget the filters and just swipe to meet random people online.<br><br>\u2605 Everyone likes a full message box, right?<br>DM people you liked. If you are a little shy to video chat instantly, DM first and enjoy texting. You can hop on a direct call whenever you feel comfortable.<br><br>\u2605 Filters to find the most desirable profiles<br>Gaze filters your preferences and finds the perfect people for you to chat with. It is the easiest way to meet strangers who are just like you and share common interests!<br><br>\u2605 Follow your friends<br>Follow your favorite people to get notified when they are online and live video chat with them anytime. You can also increase your following on Gaze and be one of the popular Gazers.<br><br>\ud83d\udd12 Private and secure<br>Gaze has a 24-hour moderation. If your connection behaves offensively, is rude to you, or does something else that is against the laws or Gaze policies, you can always report users while live video chatting and they will get reviewed by our moderation team.<br><br>Lots of Love,<br>\ud83d\udc9b \u2764\ufe0fGaze Team \u2764\ufe0f \ud83d\udc9b<br><br>IG: gaze_videochat<br>Questions? Contact us at customerdesk@gazeapp.mobi<br>Privacy Policy: www.gazeapp.mobi/privacy<br>Terms of Service: www.gazeapp.mobi/terms",
